            "Cognizant",
            "Capgemini"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "scp-11",
          "type": "checkpoint",
          "group": "interview-prep",
          "title": "Explain your own code out loud",
          "why": "The technical interview is mostly walk me through what you did. Re-open three problems you solved and narrate the approach, the complexity, and one case you got wrong first.",
          "reading": [
            {
              "label": "Big-O notation refresher",
              "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_O_notation"
            }
          ],
          "subtopics": [
