      "id": "java-developer",
      "role": "Java Developer",
      "tagline": "Core Java, collections, Spring Boot",
      "summary": "Java is still what most Indian service and product companies build on. This path takes you from syntax to a deployable Spring Boot service, with the data-structure work that interviews actually test sitting alongside it rather than after it.",
      "forWho": "Students targeting Java backend roles, or anyone whose college stack is Java.",
